                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.981/67: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-09-25T19:00:00+01:00">September 25, 1939—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 25—4:42 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1425. My 1414, September 15 [<hi rendition="#italic">25</hi>], 10 a.m.<anchor
                        n="24" xml:id="d634-f1"/> Consul General Davis and staff arrived in Berlin
                    this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">kirk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
